<p id="refresh-asof" class="note"></p><div id="refresh-cards" class="freshness-grid"></div>
<p class="note">Source keys are not a certificate of unique physical-season games. A plan row is an instruction or disposition, not a forecast, a completed fit or an immutable issue. A current state is the producer's recorded classification and requires its original proof. The browser does not acquire sources or schedule work.</p>
